<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche declines comment on Astra.</title>
<headline>Roche declines comment on Astra.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roche Holding AG declined comment on rumours that it was interested in buying Sweden's Astra AB.</p>
<p>&quot;Our answer is the same. We cannot comment on market rumours,&quot; a Roche spokesman said.</p>
<p>The Roche spokesman late on Wednesday declined comment on rumours circulating in London that it may be preparing for a hostile bid or a merger with Smithkline Beecham Plc.</p>
<p>Roche is often mentioned as a possible suitor when takeover speculation focuses on a large pharmaceutical group.</p>
<p>It was in the past rumoured to be a potential suitor for Zeneca Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
